{"title":"Wednesday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/958371101/0/marginalrevolution~Wednesday-assorted-links.html","date":1782316971000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.aeaweb.org/articles?id=10.1257/aeri.20250281&amp;from=f\" target=\"_blank\">From my colleague Jonathan Beauchamp</a>.</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://yashenghuang.substack.com/p/china-as-an-absolute-advantage-economy\" target=\"_blank\">Why is China still exporting T-shirts?</a></p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/Jon_Hartley_/status/2069226969561002189?s=20\" target=\"_blank\">Greenspan and Keynes crossed paths in 1944</a>.  Clarinet!</p>\r\n<p>4.<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nytimes.com/2026/06/22/opinion/ai-doom-jobs-economy.html\" target=\"_blank\"> Robert Shiller opposes AI negativity</a> (NYT).</p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/The_DC_Bob/status/2069137787912139042\" target=\"_blank\">The opportunity cost of Trae is really not that large</a>.  Think in terms of <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/BrettSiegelNBA/status/2069134921365385697\" target=\"_blank\"><em>opportunity cost</em></a> here, not “cost.”  By the time the Wizards need to up the pay of their younger players, Trae’s contract will be expiring.</p>\r\n<p>6. “<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.sacbee.com/news/politics-government/capitol-alert/article316150106.html\" target=\"_blank\">A new bill seeks to restrict who can and cannot teach a course at the California State University’s 22 campuses. The criterion, though, is pretty simple: to be a professor, you must be human.</a>“</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/06/wednesday-assorted-links-559.html\">Wednesday assorted links</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/958371101/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/958371101/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/958371101/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/958371101/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/958371101/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/958371101/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/06/wednesday-assorted-links-559.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/06/wednesday-assorted-links-559.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/06/wednesday-assorted-links-559.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/06/wednesday-assorted-links-559.html#comment-161055220\">6. You mean we don't have to be gay to teach in CA?!</a> <i>by Franzish</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/06/wednesday-assorted-links-559.html#comment-16